  "A labor strike ignited a Caribbean uprising.",
  "It began on May 30, 1969, in Curaçao.",
  "Workers protested, but the rally turned violent.",
  "Looting and property destruction spread through Willemstad.",
  "Rioting continued into the night of June 1.",
  "Economic decline and high unemployment fueled the unrest.",
  "Activists also fought against the island's colonial status."
